    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Wild crops will spawn in climates near where the crop itself can be cultivated, so if looking for a specific crop, look in the climate where the crop can be cultivated. However, unlike $(l:food/crops)Crops$() that the player has planted, wild crops do not require $(l:food/hydration)Hydration$(). Instead, they are found in areas depending on the average $()Temperature$() and $()Rainfall$().",
